=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Fruit flies and humans use different sex-determining signals.
- Dosage compensation balances X-linked gene expression.
- X inactivation produces cellular mosaics in mammals.
- Sex-chromosome number and SRY can affect development.

